Speech 2 Speech:  audio(i/p)--> Audio Model(only)-->( realtime o/p) audio (customer care)
Chained Architecture: audio(i/p)--> text--> existing (Any)LLM-->text(o/p)--> audio (customer care)


User Voice
   ↓
Speech-to-Text (SpeechRecognition)
   ↓
LLM Processing (OpenRouter/OpenAI API)
   ↓
Text Response
   ↓
Text-to-Speech (gTTS/pygame)
   ↓
Audio Output